<title>SWEDEN: Swedish airports handle 14 pct more cargo in Sept.</title>
<headline>Swedish airports handle 14 pct more cargo in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish airports handled 14 percent more cargo in September this year than September 1995, Sweden's civil aviation administration Luftfartsverket said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Luftfartsverket published the following figures about activity at Swedish airports in September.</p>
<p>					  SEPT		   JAN-SEPT</p>
<p>				  1996	 1995	1996	1995</p>
<p> Cargo (in tonnes)	 14,029     12,343   107,539    95,917</p>
<p> Mail (in tonnes)	   2,862	2,420    24,332    19,120</p>
<p> Landings		    31,294     28,566   252,827   246,203</p>
<p> Passengers (in millions) 1.680	1.569    13.297    12.574</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
</text>
